  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hoop paa?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006F00700020007000610061003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cosa ti prende, Hoopa?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTi interessa qualcosa che ha con sé <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿਉil signorla signora \n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh cielo... Cosa sono quelle caramelle?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006300690065006C006F002E002E002E00200043006F0073006100200073006F006E006F0020007100750065006C006C006500200063006100720061006D0065006C006C0065003F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Caramelle zipzap",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006100720061006D0065006C006C00650020007A00690070007A006100700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ne vuoi una?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0065002000760075006F006900200075006E0061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle che scoppiettano in bocca? Mi fanno\nun po’ paura, però potrei imparare qualcosa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ne prendo una, grazie.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00650020007000720065006E0064006F00200075006E0061002C0020006700720061007A00690065002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oooh!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006F006F0068002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ho l’impressione che con queste si potrebbe\npreparare una ciambella deliziosa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Signor<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, un momento solo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690067006E006F007200100003110000FF0100006100200010000201000000002C00200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F00200073006F006C006F002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ecco qui! Una nuova ricetta per le ciambelle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500630063006F0020007100750069002100200055006E00610020006E0075006F007600610020007200690063006500740074006100200070006500720020006C00650020006300690061006D00620065006C006C0065002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Servirebbero i seguenti valori, per cortesia.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nZuccherino: 40 o superiore.\nPiccante: 200 o superiore.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAcidulo: 400 o superiore.\nAmarognolo: 280 o superiore<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFresco: 40 o superiore.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 192
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quando vorrai preparare la nuova ciambella,\nvieni da me!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750061006E0064006F00200076006F007200720061006900200070007200650070006100720061007200650020006C00610020006E0075006F007600610020006300690061006D00620065006C006C0061002C000A007600690065006E00690020006400610020006D0065002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ecco la stuzzicante ciambella <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Glassata plasma<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>,\nispirata alle Caramelle zipzap!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi chiedo quale Luminopoli dimensionale\nci farebbe visitare, se la dessimo a Hoopa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vieni con urgenza al <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Piazzale del terminal<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600690065006E006900200063006F006E00200075007200670065006E007A006100200061006C002000100002FF000006005000690061007A007A0061006C0065002000640065006C0020007400650072006D0069006E0061006C00100002FF000000002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sembra sia successo un altro guaio, ma sono\ncerta che ce la farai, signor<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guarda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700750061007200640061002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nemmeno tu avevi mai visto prima una\ndistorsione dimensionale così, vero?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "È la prima volta, sì",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C80020006C00610020007000720069006D006100200076006F006C00740061002C0020007300EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "È gialla, vedo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C80020006700690061006C006C0061002C0020007600650064006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non ho idea di quali Pokémon ci siano al suo\ninterno, perciò ti ho chiamato.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ohilà, ci faresti un favore?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680069006C00E0002C0020006300690020006600610072006500730074006900200075006E0020006600610076006F00720065003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Abbiamo rilevato una distorsione incredibile!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDentro dev’esserci un Pokémon tremendo.\nE se gli prende una megaevoluzione ferox,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsiamo messi male.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAndate a indaga’ in tre, come al solito.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 200
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ci penso io a chiama’ la miss Megapietra e\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿउla vostrail vostro leader.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vi beccherete al <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Piazzale del terminal<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600690020006200650063006300680065007200650074006500200061006C002000100002FF000006005000690061007A007A0061006C0065002000640065006C0020007400650072006D0069006E0061006C00100002FF000000002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sono già lì",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006E006F00200067006900E00020006C00EC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So dove andare",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200064006F0076006500200061006E00640061007200650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, sei veramente intrigante, tu!\nBene, allora mi raccomando!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000730065006900200076006500720061006D0065006E0074006500200069006E00740072006900670061006E00740065002C0020007400750021000A00420065006E0065002C00200061006C006C006F007200610020006D006900200072006100630063006F006D0061006E0064006F002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Credo che Corvin sarebbe un ottimo sindaco.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043007200650064006F002000630068006500200043006F007200760069006E0020007300610072006500620062006500200075006E0020006F007400740069006D006F002000730069006E006400610063006F002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ORNELLA IN ARRIVO!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0052004E0045004C004C004100200049004E002000410052005200490056004F002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001> ha detto che\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂legli ci vorrà un po’ per arrivare.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C002000100002018B000100200068006100200064006500740074006F0020006300680065000A00100003110000FF0302006C00650067006C006900200063006900200076006F0072007200E000200075006E00200070006F20190020007000650072002000610072007200690076006100720065002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perciò dovremo pensarci noi due da sol<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāie.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500720063006900F200200064006F007600720065006D006F002000700065006E007300610072006300690020006E006F0069002000640075006500200064006100200073006F006C00100003110000FF010100690065002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ornella, coprirò io la sua assenza.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0072006E0065006C006C0061002C00200063006F007000720069007200F200200069006F0020006C0061002000730075006100200061007300730065006E007A0061002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Matière!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610074006900E800720065002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ci siamo viste nella Luminopoli dimensionale,\nprima dell’Operazione Megaciambella.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anche tu sei una grande esperta nell’utilizzare\nla megaevoluzione, giusto?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allora no problem! Stavolta ci andiamo noi tre!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F007200610020006E006F002000700072006F0062006C0065006D002100200053007400610076006F006C0074006100200063006900200061006E006400690061006D006F0020006E006F00690020007400720065002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Fammi sapere appena sei pront<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000460061006D006D0069002000730061007000650072006500200061007000700065006E00610020007300650069002000700072006F006E007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002C000A001000020100000000100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entriamo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0074007200690061006D006F003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entriamo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0074007200690061006D006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Devo prepararmi...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650076006F002000700072006500700061007200610072006D0069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Beh, è la prima volta, per questo trio! È giusto\nprepararsi a dovere.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200650068002C002000E80020006C00610020007000720069006D006100200076006F006C00740061002C0020007000650072002000710075006500730074006F0020007400720069006F0021002000C8002000670069007500730074006F000A00700072006500700061007200610072007300690020006100200064006F0076006500720065002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Io sono pronta quando volete! La pace\ndi Luminopoli ha la priorità su tutto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aspetta, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! I tuoi box sono pieni,\nnon potrai catturare Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300700065007400740061002C00200010000201000000002100200049002000740075006F006900200062006F007800200073006F006E006F0020007000690065006E0069002C000A006E006F006E00200070006F0074007200610069002000630061007400740075007200610072006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Essendo una detective, so che per visitare\nuna Luminopoli dimensionale particolare<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nti serve una ciambella altrettanto unica!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZERAORA?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 8,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A004500520041004F00520041003F002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il Pokémon di tipo Elettro più forte di tutti...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNon oso immaginare cosa succederebbe se\ncadesse in preda alla megaevoluzione ferox...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anche un’Allenatrice del tuo livello si sente\nintimidita, Ornella?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00630068006500200075006E20190041006C006C0065006E006100740072006900630065002000640065006C002000740075006F0020006C006900760065006C006C006F002000730069002000730065006E00740065000A0069006E00740069006D00690064006900740061002C0020004F0072006E0065006C006C0061003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Figurati!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069006700750072006100740069002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sono semplicemente entusiasta di poter\naffrontare un avversario così temibile!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo calmerò per liberarlo dalle sofferenze della\nmegaevoluzione ferox.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 6676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F002000630061006C006D0065007200F200200070006500720020006C006900620065007200610072006C006F002000640061006C006C006500200073006F00660066006500720065006E007A0065002000640065006C006C0061000A006D00650067006100650076006F006C0075007A0069006F006E00650020006600650072006F0078002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La concentrazione di energia mega nei dintorni\nè salita improvvisamente!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAttenzione: l’esemplare che hai identificato sta\nper andare incontro alla megaevoluzione ferox!",
