      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470072006F006F006F006F0077006C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cattura Zeraora, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 7200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061007400740075007200610020005A006500720061006F00720061002C00200010000201000000002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era fortissimo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 7256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450072006100200066006F007200740069007300730069006D006F002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ogni tanto Zeraora appare in città, come se fosse\nalla ricerca di qualcuno da sfidare.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nE a volte fa anche da guardia del corpo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 7296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chissà se questa Luminopoli dimensionale è nata\nproprio dal suo desiderio di diventare più forte...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 7568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ora torniamocene nella nostra Luminopoli, che\nne dite?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 7776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0072006100200074006F0072006E00690061006D006F00630065006E00650020006E0065006C006C00610020006E006F00730074007200610020004C0075006D0069006E006F0070006F006C0069002C0020006300680065000A006E006500200064006900740065003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 7896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, Ornella...\nQuindi è in questo modo che proteggete la città.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 7908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C0020004F0072006E0065006C006C0061002E002E002E000A005100750069006E00640069002000E800200069006E002000710075006500730074006F0020006D006F0064006F0020006300680065002000700072006F00740065006700670065007400650020006C00610020006300690074007400E0002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "È stata davvero un’impresa, i miei complimenti!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 8048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C80020007300740061007400610020006400610076007600650072006F00200075006E20190069006D00700072006500730061002C002000690020006D00690065006900200063006F006D0070006C0069006D0065006E00740069002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grazie a te, piuttosto!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSenza di te non saremmo mai riuscit<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāie a placare\nZeraora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 8152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scusate, ho fatto tardi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 8,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 8340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006300750073006100740065002C00200068006F00200066006100740074006F002000740061007200640069002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdonatemi, vi ho fatto aspettare!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 8400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500720064006F006E006100740065006D0069002C00200076006900200068006F00200066006100740074006F0020006100730070006500740074006100720065002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Abbiamo già fatto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 8480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410062006200690061006D006F00200067006900E000200066006100740074006F002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh? Ma... Matière?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 8528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068003F0020004D0061002E002E002E0020004D00610074006900E800720065003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uh? Matière?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
